# Repo-relative paths Engram backs up nightly because git does not hold them.
# Internal design records and the wild port's verification record live only here.
.cortexkit/internal-docs/
.cortexkit/scripts/
.cortexkit/alfonso/drafts/
.cortexkit/alfonso/specs/
